<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "AIDSphobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Fear of AIDS" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000032> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonism or disgust directed toward individuals with HIV/AIDS or behaviors perceived as putting oneself at risk for contracting HIV/AIDS. AIDS phobia may include isolation, stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence." .
