<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000033> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Abbreviation for AIDS-related complex, a term used early in the AIDS epidemic to describe people with symptomatic HIV infections who have not been formally diagnosed with AIDS. Since 2000, clinical use of the term has been largely discontinued." .
