<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000894> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Strong feelings of affection arising out of kinship, personal ties, or intimate relationships between two or more LGBTQ+ people. Can be used to describe the particularities of love as experienced by LGBTQ+ people in a given culture, as well as the ways love is discussed and expressed within LGBTQ+ communities." .
