<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000120> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The legal gender marker recorded in birth-related certifications and registries. Often but not always used synonymously with “sex assigned at birth.\" Also used in reference to the gendered roles and expectations associated with said gender marker." .
