<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000123> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bisexual people of African descent born in the United States or bisexual people born in African countries who live in or have a strong connection to the United States. Use for individuals who self-identity as African American. Follow the individual’s preference for African American or Black whenever possible." .
