<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000252> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Wearable accessories, typically consisting of leather straps and metal rings or points of attachment, that fit around the chest and shoulders like a vest. May be worn as a fashion statement, to signal one's belonging to the leather or BDSM communities, or to restrict the wearer's movement during sex." .
