<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000303> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Reorientation therapy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000303> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sexual reorientation therapy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000303> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Efforts to change the sexual or gender identity of an individual who is or is suspected to be LGBTQ+ to meet heterosexual or cisgender norms, typically under the belief that being LGBTQ+ is dangerous and/or the result of mental illness or trauma. The processes involved in conversion therapy include visualization training, spiritual interventions, and other aversion treatments. " .
