<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000348> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Temporary physical and legal confinement of LGBTQ+ people by an institution or authority, typically pending criminal charges or deportation. Can also be used to describe individuals held in custody for political purposes or within the context of war." .
