<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Drab (LGBTQ+ culture)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Drab" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000366> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Slang term used to describe people wearing masculine clothing, typically drag queens or crossdressers who also sometimes wear feminine clothing. Drab is a shortened form of the phrase \"dressed as a boy\" or \"dress resembling a boy.\"" .
