<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Drag balls" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000368> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Events that are part of the drag ball subculture that emerged in early 20th-century New York City among primarily African-American and Latin American LGBTQ+ people. During a drag ball, individuals \"walk\" or perform for prizes." .
