<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Drag families" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000371> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Groups of drag performers who share a community and typically live in close quarters with one another. Drag families are headed by drag mothers or drag fathers, with other members termed drag daughters and sons. Members of a drag family typically use the same last name as their drag mother or father (e.g., Xtravaganza) in social contexts or while performing." .
