<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000411> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People and organizations that encourage people to resist entering or pursuing same-sex relationships, to eliminate homosexual desires, to develop heterosexual desires, and/or to enter into heterosexual relationships." .
