<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Faeries" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Radical Faeries" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Faes" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000415> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Queer people who are involved with or identify with the countercultural movement seeking to redefine queer consciousness through secular spirituality. Often but not always associated with the Radical Faeries, a loosely affiliated worldwide network that formed in the 1970s." .
