<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000530> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Groups of people united by a religion or religious practices that are accepting and supportive of LGBTQ+ people and their identities. Includes large-scale organized groups, such as denominations or sects, as well as small-scale groups, such as specific churches, mosques, temples, or congregations." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000530> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Christian church founded in 1968 by Troy Perry as a welcoming spiritual gathering place for LGBT Christians; MCC is now an international denomination" .
