<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000534> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Movement within queer communities that is described as a radical alternative to gay culture being brought into the mainstream; directly posits an alternative view of gay pride events and activities that rejects increasing commercialization, corporate sponsors, and \"safer\" agendas to avoid offending heterosexual supporters and sponsors." .
