<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Genderfluid people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000570> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who identify as different genders at different times, including multiple genders at once or none at all. Only use to describe people who self-identify as genderfluid." .
