<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender non-conforming people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000574> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who identify outside, transgress, or do not conform to a given culture's gender roles or expectations. Only use in reference to people who self-identity as gender non-conforming. Do not use to describe cisgender people whose dress or behaviors do not conform to gender roles or expectations." .
