<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender relations" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000575> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The culturally specific rights, responsibilities, and connections afforded to individuals or communities of one gender by individuals or communities of another gender." .
