<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender swapping" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Gender roleplay" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000576> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A media trope (commonly used in fanfiction and fanart) in which one or more characters switch binary sexes (e.g., a cisgender man transforms into a cisgender woman), often temporarily." .
