<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000645> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Outdated term for lesbians and gay men. The use of the word began to disappear with the emergence of the gay liberation movement of the late 1960s and early 1970s." .
