<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Hypereroticism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Hyperlibido" .
