<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000673> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0000673" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Intersex rights" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000673> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Legal, social, or ethical principles of freedom or entitlement held by intersex people. Often used to refer to intersex people's right to bodily autonomy and, specifically, their right to delay or decline unnecessary medical interventions." .
