<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000676> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who are Inuit, or part of several Indigenous peoples inhabiting the Inuit homeland in the Arctic and subarctic regions of Greenland, Canada, and Alaska. Only use for people who identify as Inuit." .
