<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000687> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In Thailand, this term refers to a range of people of non-normative gender expressions, including intersex people, transgender women, and effeminate gay men. Some regard this term as outdated and offensive, while others self-identify with it. Only use to describe people who self-identify as katoey." .
