<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000798> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lesbian youth literature" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000798> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Written literary works for an audience of readers from 12-18 years of age, also known as young adult literature or YA; use in reference to youth literature focusing on lesbian characters or themes." .
