<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000884> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Confinement, including physical and/or legal restraint, of LGBTQ+ people by an institution or authority. Typically used to describe confinement to a public or private prison that is sentenced by a court within a penal system." .
