<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000920> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antagonism or disgust directed towards LGBTQ+ identities or people due to their sexuality or gender, perceived or actual. LGBTQ+ phobia can include denial of the existence of certain LGBTQ+ identities, stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence." .
