<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000975> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Rooms or areas in public or commercial spaces where people change clothes, bathe, and store items or personal belongings. LGBTQ+ people, particularly trans people, are often restricted from using locker rooms under the pretense of public safety." .
