<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001008> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Adults who self-identify as men and understand their gender in terms of Western conceptions of manliness, maleness, and/or masculinity. The term has typically been defined as adult male humans, though not all men identify with the term \"male\" depending on the context in which it is used." .
