<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Medical practitioners' statements" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001005> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Official documents from medical practitioners (e.g., doctors, nurses, therapists) diagnosing a patient's gender dysphoria and, typically, recommending gender-affirming healthcare; sometimes required for an individual's gender-affirming healthcare to be covered under insurance or for an individual to legally change their name or gender marker." .
