<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001074> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The legal parent-child relationship that may be established by biological relations, at birth, or through adoption. These rights may include child custody and visitation, decision-making authority, and informational access. " .
