<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001090> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An individual's ability to \"pass,\" or be accepted or regarded as a member of the gender they identify with. \"Passing\" has historically been used to describe an individual's ability to \"pass\" as a certain race or ethnicity, though the term was later appropriated by the LGBTQ+ community." .
