<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001115> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Form of manual stimulation involving gripping, pulling, or putting tension on parts of one’s body or another person's body for sexual stimulation, arousal, or pleasure." .
