<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001115> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001116> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001116" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pink triangles" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001116> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "International symbol of gay pride and the gay rights movement that symbolizes the reclamation of the pink triangles used in Nazi Germany to identify gay men (and, later, bisexual men and transgender women) who were sent to concentration camps." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000954> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000954> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001116> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/pinkTriangles> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001116> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001116> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
