<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001119> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001119" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Cops" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A civil force empowered by the state to enforce the law and maintain public order." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001120> .
