<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001122" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police raids" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Dawn raids" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "No-knock raids" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of residences or establishments by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001121> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001119> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000611> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/replaces> <http://homosaurus.org/v2/policeRaids> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2019-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001123> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001123" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Polyamory" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Practice of engaging in romantic, sexual, or play relationships with more than one person simultaneously, with the knowledge and consent of all parties involved." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001651> .
