<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001662> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000302> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000603> .
