<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Queer identity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001178> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Identity term that can be used to describe several not-necessarily-mutually-exclusive understandings of queerness. Queerness can describe identities that exist outside of or between different identities, and also identities that actively resist normative understandings of sexuality and/or gender. This term should only be used for those who self-identify as queer." .
