<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Radical feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001230> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Perspective within feminism that calls for a radical reordering of society in which male supremacy is eliminated in all social and economic contexts." .
