<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sex work (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001277> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people who receive money or goods in exchange for sexual services, performances, or companionship. Use to describe LGBTQ+ people working across the broad spectrum of sex work." .
