<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001551> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A twelve step program based in the U.S. that treats alcoholism as a disease and aims to address its impact on the adult lives of children of alcoholics; may be used in reference to LGBTQ+ members of ACA or LGBTQ+-focused chapters of ACA" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001551> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An international organization aimed toward supporting alcoholics in sobriety through a twelve-step program; may be used in reference to LGBTQ+ individuals in AA or LGBTQ+ chapters of AA" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001551> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Recovery groups, or voluntary associations of people in recovery from use disorders, conditions, or addictions, that are accepting and supportive of LGBTQ+ people and their identities." .
