<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Allosexuality" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001531> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A sexual orientation generally characterized by the occurrence of sexual attraction or the desire for partnered sexual experiences." .
