<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001535> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0001535" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001535> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Compulsory sexuality" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001535> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The belief that everyone should be either sexually available or in a sexual relationship." .
