<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sobriety" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ people practicing sobriety" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002228> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Conscious abstinence from addictive or mind-altering substances, typically alcohol or drugs." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002228> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people intentionally refraining from substance use (typically drugs or alcohol). Follow the individual's preference for \"sobriety\" or \"recovery\" whenever possible." .
