<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Uranianism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001564> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Historical term originating from the German \"Uranismus\" coined by Karl Heinrich Ulrichs as an umbrella term for what are now referred to as gender and sexual minorities; use only in historical contexts." .
