<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001639> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Breasts considered small within a given cultural context. In certain situations, medical professionals may refer to such breasts as \"underdeveloped\" or \"hypoplastic.\" These terms can be considered offensive and should not be used outside of specific medical contexts. The alternate labels included here are intended to aid search tools only and should not be used in other contexts." .
