<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001645> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anchor partners" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001645> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A term used in non-monogamous communities to refer to a long-term partner with multiple commitments. Often used in place of language that is seen as hierarchical (e.g., primary/secondary partner)." .
