<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Assigned sex" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An individual's sex as determined by a medical practitioner or provider. Determination is usually based on the appearance of external genitalia but may use other methodologies. In practice, sex assigned at birth is often culturally variable; the term \"assigned gender\" is often more applicable or accurate.\r\n" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001269> .
