<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001652> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who partially, but not fully, identify women or girls irrespective of their assigned genders. Used by cisgender, transgender, transfeminine, or nonbinary people who feel more strongly aligned with women physically or socially, but not strongly enough to identify solely as one." .
