<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001653> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who partially, but not fully, identify as men or boys irrespective of their assigned genders. Used by cisgender, transgender, transmasculine, or nonbinary people who feel more aligned with men physically or socially, but not strongly enough to identify solely as one." .
