<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Honeymooning" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001655> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A period of time in a relationship characterized by passionate love as well as intense feelings of attraction and ecstasy, sometimes accompanied by idealization of a partner or the shared relationship." .
