<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nesting partners" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001657> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A term used in non-monogamous communities to refer to partners an individual lives with. Often used in place of language that is seen as hierarchical (e.g., primary partner, secondary partner)." .
