<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001661> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "NRE (New Relationship Energy)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001661> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A strong, almost giddy feeling of excitement and infatuation common in the beginning of a new romantic relationship. Often used in polyamory contexts." .
