<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001662> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Paramours" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001662> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In polyamory contexts, paramours are the partners of an individual's partner, typically as part of a relationship the primary partner is unaware of. In other contexts, this term is used broadly as a synonym for lovers." .
