<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001780> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Abbreviated form of the phrase \"trans for trans,\" a label used to describe trans people who prioritize engaging in romantic, sexual, or other relationships with other trans people." .
