<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001788> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individuals who pose as the date or partner of someone they are not in a relationship with, typically to prevent that person's sexuality from becoming public knowledge; most commonly used to refer to a woman pretending to be dating a gay man." .
