<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001813> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Special collections (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001813> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Special collections that hold materials primarily pertaining to LGBTQ+ people or intended for use by LGBTQ+ people. Special collections tend to be a blend of institutional types (e.g., an archives with a museum component). This term should be applied to institutions that refer to themselves as special collections; otherwise, use the term \"LGBTQ+ cultural heritage institutions.\"" .
