<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001814> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Individuals who express fetishistic interest in and pursue sexual encounters with others based solely on their affiliation with a (typically marginalized) group that the chaser does not belong to. Often coupled with other terms to identify the type of chaser." .
