<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001903> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term coined by coined by Trudy of the womanist blog Gradient Lair to describe the intersection of transphobia, misogyny, and anti-Black racism as directed toward Black trans women." .
