<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002039> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002039" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Feminist theory" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Feminist philosophy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Theory of feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002039> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The extension of feminism into theoretical, fictional, or philosophical discourse, often seeking to understand the nature of gender inequity." .
