<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Feminine of center" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "FOC" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Fem of center" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Femme of center" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002043> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Term used to describe individuals whose gender expression is more feminine than androgynous. Generally used as a self-descriptor within LGBTQ+ communities." .
