<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Boys Love" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002152> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The manga and anime genre of fictional male-male romance created for a primarily female audience; sometimes used interchangeably with \"Yaoi\" in English (but not in Japanese)." .
