<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002168> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Anthropomorphized animal versions of people. Fursonas, which are created by members of the furry fandom, are not necessarily animals with fur; they can also be reptiles, birds, or fictional animals, for example." .
