<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002198> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Names used to describe common pairings in fandom. Ship names are often portmanteaus of the names of two (or more) characters in the ship (e.g., Spirk for Spock and Kirk)." .
