<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002270> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002270" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Black feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Afro feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Afro-feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of feminism that developed in response to the failures of mainstream feminist and civil rights efforts to acknowledge the ways white supremacy and the patriarchy interact to inform the particular experiences of Black women." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000437> .
