<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002272> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002273> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002273" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "QTPOC" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Queer and trans people of color" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002273> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Acronym used to refer to queer and trans people of color as a group. Typically used to acknowledge the particularities of queer and trans people of color's experiences and the intersections of queerphobia, transphobia, and racism as directed towards queer and trans people of color." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001892> .
