<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sapphic identity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sapphist identity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002276> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sexual identity or sexuality term used to describe women and, in some definitions, non-binary people who are sapphic, or attracted to women. Only use to describe individuals who describe their identity as sapphic." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001295> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002277> .
