<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Black ace people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002334> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Black people who are asexual. Use only for individuals who self-identity as Black. Follow the individual’s preference for African American or Black whenever possible." .
