<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002380> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002380" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Criminalization of homosexuality" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Criminalization of same-gender relations" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Criminalization of same-sex relations" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Criminalization of acts considered to be sexual or romantic between individuals perceived as being of the same gender category in a given sociocultural context." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002379> .
