<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002381" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+-related establishments" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti-LGBTQ+ police raids" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+ establishments" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police raids on LGBTQ+ venues" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police raids to LGBTQ+ venues" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of establishments owned or frequented by LGBTQ+ people by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001122> .
