<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002390> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002390" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Defund the police movement" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Defund the Police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Movement to defund police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Primarily a U.S. American and Canadian movement which supports divesting funds from, or abolition of, police departments (and often police structures generally) and reallocating them to non-policing forms of public safety and community support, such as social services, youth services, housing, education, healthcare and other community resources." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001322> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001119> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002391> .
