<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002393> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002393" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Digital identification of LGBTQ+ people by police" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Digital stop and search to identify LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Identification of LGBTQ+ people by police using phone data" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Police use of digital tools to identify LGBTQ+ people" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Identification of LGBTQ+ people, or people believed to be LGBTQ+, by police using digital tools, such as phone records, mobile applications, facial identification algorithms, and artificial intelligence technologies. Such data is then used to entrap and prosecute LGBTQ+ persons, especially in areas where being LGBTQ+ is still criminalized." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002392> .
