<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002397> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Historical and contemporary linkages between white supremacist ideologies and modern policing institutions, primarily discussed within the context of the countries of Canada and the United States." .
