<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002399> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A part of the Black Lives Matter movement which specifically advocates for Black trans people (especially Black trans women) and fights for racial equity and Black liberation." .
