<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "69-ing" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "69" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sixty-Nining" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002578> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "69ing refers to an act of shared oral sex between two people simultaneously giving and receiving oral sex, said to look similar to the number 69." .
