<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002581> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002581" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Appropriation of Two-Spirit identity" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of cultural appropriation involving identification with Two-Spirit identity by people who cannot claim citizenship, belonging, and/or descent from Indigenous people in North America." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002580> .
