<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Appropriation of marginalized identities" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002582> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Falsely claiming belonging to a marginalized group (including, but not limited to: disability, ethnicity, race, and sexuality)." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002580> .
