<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002583> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002583" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Queerspawn " .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People with one or more queer parent or caregiver, usually for self-identification. Queerspawn is believed to have been coined in 1995 or 1996 by Stefan Lynch for use in zine published by COLAGE, a U.S. based organization dedicated to supporting people with one or more LGBTQ+ caregiver." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000260> .
