<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002590> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Internalized oppression" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002590> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The phenomenon in which someone in a marginalized group internalizes or adopts oppressive beliefs (i.e., negative perceptions of and intolerance toward any marginalized identities they hold) as a result of being raised or socialized within an oppressive environment or culture." .
