<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002591> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The phenomenon in which lesbians internalize or adopt lesbophobic beliefs (i.e., negative perceptions of and intolerance toward lesbians and lesbianism) as a result of being raised or socialized within a lesbophobic environment or culture." .
