<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002844> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002846> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002846" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Intersexual" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Intersex " .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002846> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This term is not common in the English language as to not confuse intersex with a gender identity or sex orientation by adding \"ual\" but it is used in other languages such as Spanish to mean \"intersex.\" " .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002846> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002846> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isReplacedBy> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000352> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002846> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-06-28"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
