<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002857> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Asexual victims of war" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002857> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asexual people who have experienced war and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible." .
