<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002858> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002858" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002858> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Asexual victims' rights" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002858> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asexual people’s legal rights to be informed, present, and heard within the criminal justice system after having been harmed or injured as the result of a crime, accident, or other event." .
