<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002859> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002859" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Asexual-focused businesses" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002859> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Businesses focusing on asexual clientele and products related to asexual communities." .
