<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002860> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0002860" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Asexual-owned businesses" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002860> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Businesses owned by asexual people." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001735> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001735> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002860> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2023-06-28"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002860> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002860> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
