<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lateral oppression" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Lateral violence" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003091> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The phenomenon in which someone in a marginalized group displaces violence or oppression onto other members of their own group, often by acting on internalized oppressive beliefs (i.e., negative perceptions of and intolerance toward any marginalized identities they hold) adopted as a result of being raised or socialized within an oppressive environment or culture." .
