<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003092> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lateral lesbophobia" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003092> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The phenomenon in which lesbians displace violence or oppression onto other lesbians, often by acting on internalized lesbophobic beliefs (i.e., negative perceptions of and intolerance toward lesbians and lesbianism) adopted as a result of being raised or socialized within a lesbophobic environment or culture." .
