<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Masks (Erotic)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003178> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Masks worn as a fetish fashion accessory or for sensual or sexual play." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001266> .
