<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003179> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003179" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003179> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ urban fantasy fiction" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003179> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A subgenre of fantasy fiction featuring magic and supernatural creatures in contemporary urban settings; use for urban fantasy focusing on LGBTQ+ characters or themes." .
