<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003368> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Access to and experiences with reproductive health care for Two-Spirit people. Reproductive health care includes birth control, abortion, assisted reproduction, and prenatal and obstetric care." .
