<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003369> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Legal, social, or ethical principles of freedom around reproductive healthcare and decision-making. Often used to refer to an individual's right to bodily autonomy and access to legal and safe birth control, abortion, assisted reproduction, and prenatal and obstetric care." .
