<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003502> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003502" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transgender health care bans for children and youth" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003502> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Laws or policies instituted that prevent trans and non-binary youth and children from seeking and/or obtaining medical treatment or gender-affirming care, including but not limited to surgery, hormone treatment, and mental health care. " .
