<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gender marker change bans" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Legal documents change ban" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003503> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Laws or policies instituted to prevent trans and non-binary people from changing the gender marker on their birth certificate, driver's license, passport, or other legal documents." .
