<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transgender health care bans" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003504> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Laws or policies instituted to prevent trans and non-binary individuals from seeking medical treatment or gender-affirming care, including but not limited to surgery, hormone treatment, and mental health care. " .
