<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ky-ky (Gender role)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Kiki (Gender role)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Kyky (Gender role)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003506> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A slang term that emerged in the 1940s to describe lesbians who do not identify as butch or femme. Do not conflate with the term \"Kiki (Social gathering), which refers to a gathering of friends." .
