<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003507> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A genre focusing on the romantic or sexual relationships between female characters in anime, dramas, comics, novels, and movies. The term is usually used to describe media originating from Asia." .
