<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Transgender conversion therapy" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003512> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Efforts to change the gender identity of a transgender or non-binary person to meet cisgender norms, typically under the belief that their identity is dangerous and/or the result of mental illness or trauma. The processes involved in conversion therapy include visualization training, spiritual interventions, and other aversion treatments. " .
