<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003617> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ information professionals" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003617> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Information professionals (LGBTQ+)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003617> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LGBTQ+ people whose profession involves managing information by collecting, organizing, storing and disseminating it. This can include but is not limited to librarians, archivists, metadata and IT workers, web developers, and chief information officers. Use more specific terms when possible." .
