<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003654> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A period of public recognition and celebration of LGBTQ+ people and culture, usually organized over the course of a month with local events, parades, marches, and rallies. Pride occurs at different times during the year in different places but is typically held in June in the United States to commemorate the Stonewall uprising." .
