<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003660> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024-10-22"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003660> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
