<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003661> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LGBTQ+ supervillains" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003661> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Supervillains (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003661> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ super villains" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003661> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Super villains (LGBTQ)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003661> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LGBTQ+ comic book villains" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003661> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Villainous fictional characters who possess superhuman powers or abilities beyond those of ordinary people which they use to do evil and harm the public. Use to refer to supervillains who are explicitly identified as LGBTQ+ within their source material." .
