<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003737> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A movement that opposes what is referred to as \"gender ideology,\" or the belief that gender is a social construct that exists on a spectrum. Members of the anti-gender movement oppose the visibility, acceptance, and civil and reproductive rights of trans, non-binary, intersex, Two-Spirit, gender diverse, and gender non-conforming people." .
