<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003764> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of sex work that involves undressing to music while using a pole to perform dance moves, whether in a venue like a strip club or by hire at private parties. Stripping may also be performed by amateurs in private settings." .
