<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anti-sex work feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti sex work feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti-sex-work feminism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003765> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A form of feminism that alleges that sex work is inherently coercive and exploitative. Although not all sex workers are women and not all clients are men, anti-sex work feminism largely centers this gender dynamic, viewing sex work as a result and reinforcement of the patriarchy." .
