<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Camgirls" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Cam girls" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Webcam girls" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003771> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Short for \"webcam girls,\" this term refers to women sex workers who exchange sexual services, performances, or companionship via online video calls and livestreams. Use only for individuals who self-identify as camgirls; otherwise, use \"Cam models.\"" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003769> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003758> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003771> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024-10-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003771> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003771> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003772" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sex work legislation" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sex work laws" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prostitution legislation" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prostitution laws" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Laws and regulations addressing the practice, solitiation, and/or facilitation of sex work, including its legality. Legislation may variously address the actions of sex workers, their clients, third parties, and/or other individuals who work in proximity to or seek to aid sex workers." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000702> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2013003427> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000702> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024-10-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003773" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Criminalization of sex work" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Criminalisation of sex work" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sex work criminalization" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Criminalization of prostitution" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prostitution criminalization" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The process by which the practice and solicitation of sex work is made criminal, typically by introducing laws, regulations, and criminal penalties. Efforts to criminalize sex work often target street sex work and other forms of \"direct,\" visible sex work." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000314> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000702> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024-10-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003774" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Decriminalization of sex work" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Decriminalisation of sex work" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sex work decriminalization" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Decriminalization of prostitution" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prostitution decriminalization" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The process of lessening or removing laws, regulations, and/or criminal penalties targeting the practice, solicitation, and/or facilitation of sex work. Decriminalization efforts may variously address the actions of sex workers, their clients, third parties, and/or other individuals who work in proximity to or seek to aid sex workers." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000339> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000702> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024-10-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003775" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Legalization of sex work" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Legalisation of sex work" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sex work legalization" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Legalization of prostitution" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Prostitution legalization" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The creation of a set of laws and regulations intended to legalize the practice and solicitation of sex work, particularly street sex work and other forms of \"direct,\" visible sex work, within certain parameters. This may variously include legalizing the actions of sex workers, their clients, third parties, and/or other individuals who work in proximity to or seek to aid sex workers. Individuals operating outside of these laws and regulations remain subject to penalties." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000702> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024-10-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003776" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nordic model (Sex work)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "End demand (Sex work)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Equality model (Sex work)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Neo-abolition movement (Sex work)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Nordic and Swedish model (Sex work)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Swedish model (Sex work)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A legislative approach to sex work first instituted in Sweden in 1999 and then in Norway in 2009 that centers on the criminalization of clients, third parties, and many of the ways sex workers operate. The Nordic model is a form of sex work abolition predicated on the idea that no person can consent to engage in commercial sexual services and that sex workers must therefore be educated and reformed. Sex workers and activists have heavily criticized and opposed the Nordic model." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000702> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024-10-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003777" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sex work abolition" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Abolition movement (Sex work)" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sex work abolitionism" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sex work abolition movement" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A movement to abolish sex work through a variety of different means, including supporting \"end demand\" laws, the Nordic model, or the broader criminalization of sex work; organizing and speaking vocally against sex work as inherently exploitative; and rejecting efforts to recognize sex work as labor." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003765> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024-10-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003778" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Curb crawling" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kerb crawling" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The practice of driving or idling in one's car around areas known for street sex work in order to solicit sex workers." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003779> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000278> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003779> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2024-10-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2025-02-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://homosaurus.org/v3> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Version 3.7.1" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003779> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003779" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Solicitation of sex work" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Soliciting" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003779> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The act of offering or attempting to exchange money or goods for sexual services or performances." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778> .
