<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003780> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "homoit0003780" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Street sex work" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Street prostitution" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003780> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sex work that is generally solicited in a public place such as a street, street corner, or park." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001276> .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85107626> .
