<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003785> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sex work concierges" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003785> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "People who mediate between sex workers and clients. Follow the individual's preference for \"Sex work concierges,\" \"Pimps,\" or \"Madams\" whenever possible." .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003785> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003782> .
