<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anti-sex worker discrimination" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Discrimination against sex workers" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti sex worker discrimination" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti-prostitute discrimination" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Anti prostitute discrimination" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Discrimination against prostitutes" .
<https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003786> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The unjust or prejudicial treatment of sex workers due to their work or identity as a sex worker; may include the denial of legal rights, employment, and housing." .
